    {
        "text": "<p=2>November 8th, 1100    6:15 P.M.</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_only_medium",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You sent for me, Don Venezia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anton has a question for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over here, Carle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Antonio...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any cars headed towards Sicilia recently?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Passenger routes are operating as usual. Though, most people are coming in here, and not out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go pack up your belongings. You should be able to make the last ride over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gotcha\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, Huh? Antonio, what's the meaning of this?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you have a fratello in Sicilia? You can't stay in Nuova Volsinii any longer, and can't go back to Montelupe either, so you should go to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your negligence has caused us to lose a whole carload of 'tires'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave you a chance. Just greet the don at the port, couldn't even manage that. That old Saluzzo stronzo even got to meet papa before you did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Carle, I've already given you the most decent ending possible by letting you leave, alive. Take this\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2"
    },
    {
        "text": "A check from a bank, with a huge sum written on it."
    },
    {
        "text": "The famiglia associate takes it, stunned. He sees his own name written on the upper left, already crossed out by Antonio himself."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call it a settlement fee. Without the famiglia's protection, you'll need a lot of money.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been with the Venezias for more than a decade. I was following the Don before you even came in here, can't you just, for his sake\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Don Venezia\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Employees who make mistakes must naturally be punished, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. You're the head of Venezia Trucking. You call the shots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1555_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-80,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "-80,0",
        "posto": "-280,0",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anton... you didn't inform me about this in advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please don't blame me for this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The police were just here earlier. They wanted to inspect the vehicle factories and service stations under the Venezia name. They said it was just a routine inspection before Carnevale, but the official warrant said it was an impromptu check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also just received news that Alberto was suddenly temporarily detained for corporate qualification issues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no doubt the trial this morning has upset our dear judge Lavinia. She's hoping to control a situation she knows nothing of this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation spiraled out of my control, so I had to deal with Carle like that. It'll be hard to convince the masses otherwise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This year, Venezia Trucking has carefully complied with the New Urban Management Act, and the only clue we had proving otherwise was burned to cinders yesterday at the port.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only person who can affect our business has been dealt with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when Carnevale is over and Lavinia has her hands free, I'm afraid she'll try her best to target us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you plan on handling it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My original idea was to slowly transform this city\u2014Let it have a set of laws absent in other cities, while establishing an underground order the Siracusans are accustomed to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Venezia Trucking's business has been smooth sailing. The trick is to follow these two tenets: Comply with the New Urban Management Act, but also not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, the other famiglie are doing the same, but adapting to the rules of the new game is quite difficult.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Venezias can fit perfectly into both sets of laws, and we've been excelling at it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "So much so that today we can discard one and switch to the other immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "text": "So you want to completely control this city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've lost yourself, Anton. Don't forget Nuova Volsinii has Signora Sicilia's endorsement. She supports the youths' reforms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "text": "You're openly defying her authority and turning us against all of Siracusa this way. You're using the entire Famiglia Venezia as your betting chip!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounds like that, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The last one to do that was Bernardo... he only died last year!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you afraid of Signora Sicilia, afraid of the youngsters at City Hall yelling their ideals across the room?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've really gotten old, papa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We Venezias hold a most unusual seat in the Grey Hall, a 'hybrid' famiglia. Lupos with no blood ties who left their previous pack, Vulpos like Ingrid, and Perros like you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "text": "The other famiglie don't think too kindly of us, but we stand here today nonetheless. Our presence here embodies every Venezia's sweat and blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "text": "Our ties run closer than bloodlines, and I want everyone in the famiglia to have a decent end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "text": "But you, you want to put us in great danger... Anton, I think you've forgotten my teachings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Papa, have I ever mentioned how a Perro like me ended up in Siracusa?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was a soldier, serving the True Bol\u00edvarians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have but a superficial understanding of the situation in Bol\u00edvar...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It actually doesn't matter which flag you fight under in Bol\u00edvar. You don't have to understand why the three parties are fighting one another. I mean, everyone's just trying to survive by giving it their all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was in a guerrilla force raiding a village under the Singas dynasty, but we were discovered, and the entire squad became captives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The twenty of us emptied every pocket and piled our possessions together to bribe the executioner to spare us, change our status from 'death penalty' to 'hard labor'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The officer responsible for driving us was a paunchy aristocrat. He was drunk that day, made a mistake during the review process, and only came to us with a truck... big enough to sit just ten people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The executioner asked him what to do next. Can you guess how that stronzo replied?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He belched from his drink as he whipped out a pen and drew a circle on our list, saying: There's clearly only ten people on the list, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "We killed him, cut off his head, escaped Bol\u00edvar, and what happened next, I'm sure you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anton, this is the first time I've heard of\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. It's been too long I almost forgot about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know why it suddenly came back to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was discussing with our young and promising mayor about building a logistical network in the city. He refused me, and then shared how the city came about, and its mission...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "A so-called 'experimental ground', with a new order governing people from the old, vastly different from the Siracusan tradition...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "He knew people would have trouble adapting, irreconcilable conflicts would occur, and the system might even swallow groups of people in the process... but it couldn't be helped, there was a potential future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "And all of that happened because four young people sat at the Grey Hall's round table and lobbied for their idea so passionately...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signora Sicilia allocated them one of Siracusa's twenty-three cities, without hesitation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "A move so cavalier, like that aristocrat who circled half our names away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Papa, Leontuzzo was indeed quite sincere and inspiring at the time, but I almost lost control, I wanted to burst into laughter... That boy knows nothing at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said I lost myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not at all. What I want to do has always been the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hate that aristocrat and Signora Sicilia. I hate their power to wantonly draw their circles as they please. I want to take it all away from them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anton...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew\u2014Alright, Papa. I've said a bit too much today. I'm not here to let you lecture me on decency or dignity, nor am I here to analyze what's going on in Siracusa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "My activities this year alone are not enough to land a seat at the gambling table...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Papa, don't we have a landship en-route nearby? I'd like the rights to make an emergency dispatch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is something only Don Venezia can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I refuse, will the men guarding the door deal with me like how you handled Carle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not, you're a truly decent man worthy of a dignified end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1545_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Venezia Sr."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're old, Papa. Haven't you always suggested you retire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
