    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Scusi, is Eirene not here right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "...Y-Your Honor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "U-Uh, Eirene's not here. Everyone went to celebrate her acquittal, that's why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So why aren't you with them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'm just servicing these trucks. See?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "Carnevale's tomorrow, and they'll need a lot of our cars...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone has to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're lying, Signore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you see her, please let Eirene know I need to meet her, even outside of office hours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1550_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
